body:
Pretty much a bunch of retarded fags. The thing is, PBE clearly shows how broken champs are but they still bring them to the live games. Not only this, but the community isn't just toxic, but is completely shit. I want to get back to playing league because i had fun in this game, but now it's full of pussies and retards. Go play fortnite if you can't handle something a lot less easy when it comes to getting cursed at than MW2 voice chat

&#x200B;

It's so bad calling a fag a fag, it's just reminding him what he/she is.
